  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* Disable embedded file timestamps in rust-embed by @kpcyrd in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1554\r\n* rustsec: avoid warning about packages that are not from crates.io by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1573\r\n* cargo-audit: add CLI option to skip checking for yanked crates by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1574\r\n* cargo-audit: cap input size for audit bin by @glaziermag in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1516\r\n* Show affected functions in binaries by @smoelius in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1542\r\n* cargo-audit: when run with -q, suppress dependency trees by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1587\r\n* build(deps): bump object from 0.38.1 to 0.39.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1589\r\n* Affected binary tweaks by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1588",
  "mentions_count": 5
}
